   - Observation Scorer: back-end/app/intelligence/observation_scorer.py (ObservationScorer.evaluate_telemetry)

--- 2. How CWC Corroboration Affects Credibility Today ---
   - Proximity query: Incident is matched against river telemetry stations within 25 km and within 6 hours.
   - Corroboration scoring: observation_scorer.py computes a corroboration_score (0.0 to 1.0) and relationship_weight.
   - Grouping: ObservationStationGroup constructed with source_family=SourceFamily.PHYSICAL_SENSOR.
   - Signal integration in credibility_scorer.py:
       prod_o *= 1.0 - 0.60 * (corroboration_score * relationship_weight)
       physical_observation_score = 1.0 - prod_o
       synthesized_support = weight_crowd * s_crowd + weight_evidence * s_evidence + weight_observation * s_observation
       where weight_observation = 0.20
   - Cap behavior: When only physical observation corroboration exists without crowd or digital evidence,
       applicable_cap = cap_physical_only = 0.85 (and absolute max machine cap = 0.98).
   - S1 Isolation & Non-Double-Counting Rule:
       S1 adds meteorological physical corroboration (weather models/stations). The combined physical contribution
       (CWC river telemetry + S1 meteorological evidence) must be bounded by a shared PHYSICAL_CORROBORATION_TOTAL_CAP.

--- 3. Database Schema: weather_observations ---
  id: uuid (nullable=NO)
  source_id: uuid (nullable=NO)
  station_code: character varying (nullable=NO)
  station_name: character varying (nullable=NO)
  geom: USER-DEFINED (nullable=NO)
  observed_at: timestamp with time zone (nullable=NO)
  temperature_c: double precision (nullable=YES)
  humidity_pct: double precision (nullable=YES)
  rainfall_mm: double precision (nullable=YES)
  wind_speed_kmh: double precision (nullable=YES)
  wind_direction_deg: integer (nullable=YES)
  pressure_hpa: double precision (nullable=YES)
  raw_metrics: jsonb (nullable=YES)
  created_at: timestamp with time zone (nullable=NO)
  external_id: character varying (nullable=YES)
  water_level_m: double precision (nullable=YES)

